style='font-size:10.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:SimSun;background:aqua;
mso-highlight:aqua;mso-no-proof:yes'>Genelgeler</span></i><b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:
normal'><span style='font-size:10.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:SimSun;
background:aqua;mso-highlight:aqua;mso-no-proof:yes'><span style='mso-tab-count:
1'>         </span></span></b><b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><span
